<testcase>
  <info>
    <p>
      A change of span at a part boundary, in both directions, in a two-column page-sequence. First sequence: a
      two-column part, then a span="all" part starting part-way down page 2. Second sequence: a span="all" part,
      then a two-column part starting part-way down page 2. In both, every column of page 2 keeps the first
      part's master and the height left on the page, and page 3 takes the second part's master.
    </p>
